  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science/Indigenous Knowledge Unite to Reduce Forest Carbon Loss-Regional</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional coordination of the program &quot;Science/Indigenous Knowledge Unite to Reduce Forest Carbon Loss&#x201D;, which aims to reduce forest carbon emissions from indigenous landscapes caused by deforestation and forest degradation in Peru, Brazil, Colmbia and Ecuador, using a combination of scientific and local knowledge. Additional implementing partner: COICA.</narrative>
  </description>
